</div>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b>EXECUTIVE COMPENSATION</b></p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The following table sets forth summary information concerning compensation for 2025 and 2024 awarded to, earned by, or paid to Jeff W. Dick, Chairman, President and Chief Executive Officer, Thomas J. Chmelik, Senior Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer, and Abdul Hersiburane, Bank President. Richard A. Vari, Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer of the Bank, became a named executive in 2025, therefore summary information for 2024 is omitted. Messrs. Dick, Chmelik, Hersiburane and Vari received perquisites and other personal benefits in addition to other compensation during the periods stated. The aggregate amounts of these perquisites and other personal benefits for each individual, however, did not exceed $10,000 and, therefore, have been omitted.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

